{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. I've called us together because Paint Booth 4 was stopped this morning after solvent was found pooled beneath its circulation manifold. The booth is currently isolated from production and the spill area has been cordoned off. As Safety Officer, I'll be making the final decision on containment, restart authorization, and the recovery plan. Before we can restart Booth 4, the incident authorization form requires documented entries for four areas: equipment repair, hazardous-waste handling, production recovery, and disposition of any potentially contaminated panels. I need each of you to walk me through what you know so we can address all four areas and get this resolved safely. Let's start with what happened and the current state of the booth."}
```

```json
{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, Elena. I conducted the inspection this morning. I found a cracked manifold isolation valve seat — that's the root cause of the solvent pooling beneath the circulation manifold. Replacing the valve will take exactly four hours. I also have a lockout worksheet that identifies six isolation points, which I completed during the inspection. I need to get that worksheet attached to the incident record — I'll do that right after this meeting. That covers the equipment repair side from my end. I can walk through any specifics you need on the valve replacement or the lockout points."}
```

```json
{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, Elena. On the hazardous-waste handling side, I've been assessing the spill cleanup. I need to share some important findings with the group regarding the volume of contaminated liquid we're dealing with and the waste disposal requirements."}
```

