{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, Elena. On the production recovery side, I've been looking at our options for rerouting the affected Booth 4 units. I can confirm that Booth 2 has available capacity to take on some of that workload — I received confirmation from the scheduling desk on what it can handle. I have not yet revised the production board to reflect this, but I can do that once we agree on the recovery plan. I'll hold off on the specific numbers until Nadia finishes her update, since the disposition of any potentially contaminated panels may affect how many units we actually need to reroute."}
```

